flowchart TB
	subgraph Sources [External identity APIs]
		A[API connection A]
		B[API connection B]
		C[API connection C]
	end

	subgraph Triggers [Triggers]
		T1[Sync now per connection]
		T2[Sync all sources, bounded concurrency]
		T3[Scheduler, per connection cron]
	end

	A --> T1
	B --> T2
	C --> T3

	T1 --> ENG[SyncService.triggerSync connectionId]
	T2 --> ENG
	T3 --> ENG

	ENG --> STORE[(Shared User / Group / Role store)]

	subgraph Store [Per record tagged by source]
		U1[user alice, apiConnectionId A]
		U2[user bob, apiConnectionId B]
		G1[group eng, apiConnectionId A]
	end
	STORE --- Store

	ENG -. cross-connection username overlap .-> COLL[Skip + report, owner kept, run stays SUCCESS]
	ENG -. cleanup scoped to connection .-> ISO[Source A run never touches source B]

	STORE --> LOGIN[End user login by global unique username -> one user -> SAML assertion]
